        "description": "Specify the file path or select the file from your local system to upload to the Doc Library. <br>\nIf the parameter `file_name` is not passed, then the default file name is `uuid-uploaded_file_name.file_format`. Here, `uploaded_file_name` refers to the name of the file saved on your local system. <br> Example: *694892c5-Sample_file.png*",
